{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loco-Muko</strong> \u2013 <u>A Nostalgic Brain-Bending Platform Adventure!</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built by a true collector who grew up swapping gum-sticker pics in the schoolyard, Loco-Muko is a delightful <strong>mashup of logic, reflexes, and sweet childhood memories</strong>. Imagine a world where collectible pictures meet tricky jumps, your brain argues with your fingers, and the platforms aren\u2019t always what they seem. Yeah... it gets weird.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay? Super simple! <strong>Just hop from platform to platform</strong> using your arrow keys. Easy, right? Think again. These platforms have minds of their own, and they <i>definitely</i> don\u2019t care what your brain wants. You\u2019ll need sharp reflexes, clever thinking, and a high tolerance for falling off into the void. Repeatedly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But hey, it\u2019s not all pain and chaos\u2014you\u2019ll also unlock tons of fun illustrations inspired by the legendary Odra gum series. Each level brings new surprises, stories, and a blast of pure, sticker-packed nostalgia. Only the most persistent players will collect them all. Think you're up for it?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Odra gum collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3610650/39598955e22e984eb74edbaeb1483a252527dacf.jpg"},{"name":"Turbo gum collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3610650/280b4598d53caa48eeb0994813f24def4bc76236.jpg"},{"name":"Lazer gum collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3610650/189ea24842fb4bf9557e9195539a85b3d31d23d3.jpg"},{"name":"Football gum collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3610650/87502bab3a37549c90f12d1e9cc2d18bbff49b87.jpg"},{"name":"Cartoon gum collector","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com